*--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Q residue parameter file for OPLS-AA/M 2015
* Parameters extracted: from OPLS-AA/M Parameter file, OPLSA-AA/M Topology file
* (https://zarbi.chem.yale.edu/oplsaam.html)
*
* A description of the parametrization procedure can be found in the following citation:
*   Robertson, M. J.; Tirado-Rives, J.; Jorgensen, W. L. 
*   Improved Peptide and Protein Torsional Energetics with the OPLS-AA Force Field. 
*   J. Chem. Theory Comput. 2015, 11 (7), 3499-3509
*   doi:10.1021/acs.jctc.5b00356.
*
* Manually curated at Åqvist lab (Lucien Koenekoop, 2025)
*--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[options]
vdw_rule            geometric ! vdW combination rule (geometric or arithmetic )
scale_14            0.5       ! electrostatic 1-4 scaling factor
switch_atoms        on        ! on = use switch atom; off = use charge group
improper_definition explicit  ! improper representation by 2 or four atoms
improper_potential  periodic
coulomb_constant    332.0716  ! Constant in electrostatic energy calculation; default = 332.
force_field         AMBER     ! Force Field Type (GROMOS (default), AMBER or CHARMM)

